const e=[["How can I start a project?","Send us a short brief through the project form. We’ll review the scope, ask any useful questions, and return with a tailored next step."],["What editing services do you provide?","Video editing, commercial and social edits, color grading, photo retouching, product cleanup, and recurring post-production support."],["What do you need before starting?","Your goals, source files, references, deliverables, deadline, and any existing brand guidelines. A rough brief is enough to begin the conversation."],["Can you work with existing brand guidelines?","Yes. We can work within established visual systems, templates, tone, and delivery specifications."],["How long do projects take?","Timelines depend on scope, source material, and feedback cycles. We confirm a realistic schedule before work begins."],["How do quotations work?","Every quote is based on the actual scope, deliverables, complexity, and timeline. We do not publish one-size-fits-all pricing."],["Do you offer recurring editing support?","Yes. Ongoing support can be structured around a recurring content calendar or reserved monthly production capacity."],["How are revisions handled?","The agreed revision structure is documented in your proposal. Feedback is collected clearly and applied in organized review rounds."],["How are files shared?","We can work with common secure cloud-transfer and review platforms. The exact workflow is confirmed during onboarding."],["Which final formats can you deliver?","We deliver common web, social, presentation, and print-ready formats based on your channel requirements."],["Can you work with agencies?","Yes. We can support agencies as a discreet white-label post-production partner."],["How is client content handled?","Access is limited to the project workflow. Specific confidentiality or retention requirements can be agreed before work starts."]];export{e as f};
